### Reaction lookup by names
POST https://dev.lipidmaps.org/api/reactions/names HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "names":["Butyrylcarnitine", "Cholesterol", "PC 18:1"]
}

### Reaction lookup by LMSD IDs dev
POST https://dev.lipidmaps.org/api/reactions HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "search_mode": "default",
    "search_type": "all",
    "generic_reactions": false,
    "lmsd_ids": "all"
}

### Reaction lookup by LMSD IDs localhost
POST https://dev.lipidmaps.org/api/reactions HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "search_mode": "default",
    "search_type": "all",
    "generic_reactions": true,
    "lmsd_ids": ["LMGP04050000"]
}

